# Does each quote actually approximate its cited source?

The script already confirmed every citation link resolves to a real chunk of
the trajectory or a source file. `prepare` paired each quote with the text at
that exact location. Your job is the question a script cannot answer: does
the QUOTE actually say what the SOURCE says — referenced, not regenerated?

